      "html": "<div id=\"step-q148673\" class=\"step questionWidget\" stepid=\"q148673\" questionid=\"148673\" format=\"MC\" answer=\"\" current=\"false\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 3</div><div class=\"questionWidget-calculatorIcon\"><svg enable-background=\"new 0 0 128 128\" viewBox=\"0 0 128 128\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"m102.11.5h-76.22c-5.75 0-10.43 4.68-10.43 10.43v106.14c0 5.75 4.68 10.43 10.43 10.43h76.22c5.75 0 10.43-4.68 10.43-10.43v-106.14c0-5.75-4.68-10.43-10.43-10.43zm6.43 116.57c0 3.55-2.88 6.43-6.43 6.43h-76.22c-3.55 0-6.43-2.88-6.43-6.43v-106.14c0-3.55 2.88-6.43 6.43-6.43h76.22c3.55 0 6.43 2.88 6.43 6.43z\"></path><path d=\"m93.96 12.83h-59.92c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v16.57c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h59.92c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-16.57c0-2.76-2.25-5-5-5zm1 21.57c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-59.92c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-16.57c0-.55.45-1 1-1h59.92c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m43.86 45.14h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m68.91 45.14h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m93.96 45.14h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.25-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m43.86 70.7h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m68.91 70.7h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m43.86 96.26h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m68.91 96.26h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m93.96 70.7h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v35.38c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-35.38c0-2.76-2.25-5-5-5zm1 40.38c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-35.38c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path></g></svg></div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>Arthur and Sara are finding the best recipe for chocolate muffins, and they test three different oven cooking modes, mode <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"82\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> mode <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"83\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and mode <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"84\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> They also try two types of yeast, A and B.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>They use mode <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"85\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> to cook the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"86\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of their muffins, and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"87\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of those muffins turn out well.</li>\n<li>They use mode <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"88\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> to cook the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"89\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of their muffins, and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"90\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>85</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of those muffins turn out well.</li>\n<li>They use mode <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"91\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> to cook the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"92\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of their muffins, and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"93\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>88</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of those muffins turn out well.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"94\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of all muffins was prepared with yeast A, and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"95\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>87</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of yeast A muffins turn out well, what is the probability that a randomly chosen good muffin is done with yeast A? Round your answer to <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"96\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> decimal places.</p>\n</div><table class=\"questionWidget-choicesTable\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-148673-a\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\" style=\"background: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: white;\">a</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"97\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.199</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-148673-b\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">b</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"98\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.174</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-148673-c\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">c</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"99\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.203</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-148673-d\" class=\"questionWidget-